-- Tests of the trips agreement of 8.9.1998 with הסתדרות המורים against the
-- Hours of Work and Rest Law (MMS-678; the card trip-units-overtime). Its
-- §4.ד pays an escort by the hour he comes back — 5 units for a day out
-- ending between 21:00 and 24:00, 7 for each night away — each unit 0.7%
-- of the monthly combined salary (§4.ג). Measured against what the law asks
-- for the worked days (l4/lib/escort-day.l4), at the bound most generous to
-- the employer (convention instruments.regular-hour-wage): the units fall
-- short on the day out to 23:00, and on the night away even with the night
-- left out.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `escort-day`
IMPORT `1998-09-08_histadrut-hamorim_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul`

§ `בדיקות הסכם הטיולים של הסתדרות המורים מול חוק שעות עבודה ומנוחה`

GIVEN a IS A `1998 Oz out-of-school activity`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `regular hours the 1998 Histadrut units pay, at most` a IS
    `regular hours activity units pay` (`the units a 1998 Histadrut activity earns` a)
        `the share of the monthly combined salary an activity unit is worth`
        `the most hours a month of section 3's longest week holds`

`the 1998 Histadrut units pay less than the law asks for a day out to 23:00 and for a night away` MEANS
        `the instrument pays less than the Hours of Work and Rest Law asks`
            (`regular hours section 16 asks for an escort day` 8 23)
            (`regular hours the 1998 Histadrut units pay, at most` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 23))
    AND `the instrument pays less than the Hours of Work and Rest Law asks`
            (`regular hours section 16 asks for the worked night away` FALSE)
            (`regular hours the 1998 Histadrut units pay, at most` (`a 1998 activity with nights away` 1))
#ASSERT `the 1998 Histadrut units pay less than the law asks for a day out to 23:00 and for a night away`

-- 5 units are 6.825 hours of a month of 195; 7 units, 9.555.
#ASSERT `regular hours the 1998 Histadrut units pay, at most` (`a 1998 activity from the morning ending at` 23) EQUALS 6.825
#ASSERT `regular hours the 1998 Histadrut units pay, at most` (`a 1998 activity with nights away` 1) EQUALS 9.555
